Package: gcode-thumb
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Maintainer: masbytes <masbytes@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 20
Depends: python3 (>= 3.6)
Recommends: python3-pil
Description: Thumbnail generator for the preview image embedded in G-code files
 gcode-thumb extracts the preview thumbnail that slicers such as
 PrusaSlicer, SuperSlicer, OrcaSlicer and Cura embed inside .gcode files
 and registers it as a GNOME/Nautilus thumbnailer, so file managers show
 the real print preview instead of a generic text icon.
